<!--
  Channel configuration for the products this simulator models — a hand-written
  factual summary, not CME's file.

  It records only facts the tools need: each channel's id, the product codes
  and product-group codes listed on it, and the multicast group address and
  port of its incremental, snapshot and instrument-replay feeds (A and B).
  Channel names are this project's own descriptions. Products and channels the
  simulator has no contract economics for are left out.

  For CME's full, current configuration (all channels, ~5,000 products), run
      ./mdp3 fetch-config
  which downloads CME's config.xml from its FTP server to schema/config.xml;
  products.py then prefers it automatically. Contract economics (tick size, tick
  value, expiry) are in contracts.py, not here.
-->
